			"Message": "docs(Worker): Decorate License, Changelog, and Funding sections with emoji entities\n\nAdd Unicode emoji entities to the License ⚖️, Changelog 📜, and Funding 🙏🏻 section headings in README.md for visual consistency with the rest of the document. Expand the Funding & Acknowledgements section with a lead-in paragraph about Land's open-source mission, transform the sponsor logos into a structured table with header row, lowercase the Land logo URL, and remove the extraneous PlayForm steward sentence.\n\nNormalize cross-references and unify the Changelog call-to-action phrasing for a polished documentation experience.",
