			"Message": "docs(Worker): Normalize emoji entities and refine documentation accuracy\n\nReplace literal emoji characters with HTML/Unicode entities across Architecture.md, DeepDive.md, and README.md to ensure consistent rendering across platforms and editors. Collapse multi-line table cells into single lines for maintainability.\n\nCorrect several inaccuracies in README.md: fix the core cache constant name (CORE_CACHE → CACHE_CACHE), clarify that\nBASE_REMOTE is resolved at runtime (not build-injected), document that the install-time precache list is intentionally empty, and update the build constants table to accurately reflect ESBuild's define strategy for __DEV__ and __INCREMENT__.\n\nImprove cross-reference formatting using Unicode emoji entities for element names and add the Worker emoji to the overview paragraph for visual consistency.",
			"SHA": "bf17042b51dce690cb56738bdb3f067a9898e1f2"
		}
